{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/title.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Road To Yvhalon</i></strong> is a  action RPG specifically designed for Virtual Reality that merges the cryptic allure of soulslike games with a vast, non-linear world crafted for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/gifs5.gif?t=1746198396\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through forgotten lands, ancient ruins, and hidden trails. The road is only the beginning\u2014true discovery lies off the path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/Desc_Enemies.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face arcane demons in ritual-like duels using a <strong>sword pose system</strong>, where stance and intention shape the flow of combat. Every encounter is a deadly dance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/swords.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge legendary blades by merging natural resources with fragments of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/CAPTURE.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steal the souls of your foes through the <strong>SoulCapture</strong> system and command otherworldly powers\u2014flames, shadows, teleportation, visions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a world that doesn\u2019t guide you\u2014it challenges you. <i>Road To Yvhalon</i> is the path, but also what you find by losing your way.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3368470?t=1746198396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3368470?t=1746198396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/a7c3ee0c84cfc6c7323bfd7108e1260a611f50bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746198396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/a7c3ee0c84cfc6c7323bfd7108e1260a611f50bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746198396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/title.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Road To Yvhalon</i></strong> is a  action RPG specifically designed for Virtual Reality that merges the cryptic allure of soulslike games with a vast, non-linear world crafted for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/gifs5.gif?t=1746198396\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through forgotten lands, ancient ruins, and hidden trails. The road is only the beginning\u2014true discovery lies off the path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/Desc_Enemies.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face arcane demons in ritual-like duels using a <strong>sword pose system</strong>, where stance and intention shape the flow of combat. Every encounter is a deadly dance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/swords.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge legendary blades by merging natural resources with fragments of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/extras/CAPTURE.png?t=1746198396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steal the souls of your foes through the <strong>SoulCapture</strong> system and command otherworldly powers\u2014flames, shadows, teleportation, visions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a world that doesn\u2019t guide you\u2014it challenges you. <i>Road To Yvhalon</i> is the path, but also what you find by losing your way.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Levante Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368470/9afe0227bb8d92c8135d62c13d409337b677616f/header.jpg?t=1746198396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127641,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127641/movie480.mp4?t=1745852385","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127641/movie_max.mp4?t=1745852385"},"name":"Road To Yvhalon-Teaser-